            <!-- Description -->
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-lg">
                Passionate about building clean, reliable software, from interactive frontends to
                robust backend APIs. Currently working full-time while continuously growing across
                the full stack with TypeScript, Node.js, and modern web frameworks.
            </p>

